Description: Masked individual wearing a spiraling orange mask with a single eye hole. Presents an erratic, buffoonish demeanor in the field, believed to be deliberate deception. Intelligence suggests this persona conceals a highly capable operative who may hold true command of the Akatsuki.

Observed Abilities:
- Apparent intangibility; physical attacks pass through the body.
- Space-time ninjutsu allowing near-instant relocation.
- Possible Sharingan visible through the mask's eye hole.

Analyst Note: The mask conceals the left/right eye inconsistently across sightings. Identity may connect to a supposedly deceased Uchiha. Priority intelligence target. Report all sightings to ANBU Intelligence Division immediately.
